{"id":"248908af8dc82492","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion.md","title":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — restricted cnf conversion","display":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — restricted cnf conversion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion","display":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — restricted cnf conversion","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]","[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]","[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion","73-theorem-2.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — restricted cnf conversion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ade63126a30a65e4\" href=\"?note=ade63126a30a65e4\" title=\"73-df-generated-language-notation\">73-df-generated-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"67f26c889bc89ed8\" href=\"?note=67f26c889bc89ed8\" title=\"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation\">73-df-restricted-cnf-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion</span><span>73-theorem-2.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\cap\\Sigma^1=\\emptyset\">\\(L\\cap\\Sigma^1=\\emptyset\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)\\)</span>、旧版 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ade63126a30a65e4\" href=\"?note=ade63126a30a65e4\" title=\"73-df-generated-language-notation\">73-df-generated-language-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"67f26c889bc89ed8\" href=\"?note=67f26c889bc89ed8\" title=\"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation\">73-df-restricted-cnf-notation</a>；终结字母表固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>此 CNF 是禁止起始符号直接产生单字母的原接口，<strong>不是</strong>标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}\\)</span>；标准转换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L=L(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L=L(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所加的无单字母词条件是明确的充分适用条件，而非声称刻画全部可转换语言。标准 CNF 转换产生的起始符号不出现在右侧；本条件保证没有起始符号直接产生终结字母的规则，故转换结果也满足旧 CNF。原无条件版本至少在 L={a} 上失败：导出长度一若经过二叉产生式就必须使用空产生式，而唯一可空的起始符号会同时使空词进入语言。标准 CNF 转换定理仍保留一般性，未改动其对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-generated-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ade63126a30a65e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","status":"resolved","id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}$，见 [[73-df-cfl-notation]]；$L\\cap\\Sigma^1=\\emptyset$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)$、旧版 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 分别见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]、[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]、[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]；终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-generated-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ade63126a30a65e4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)$、旧版 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 分别见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]、[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]、[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]；终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","status":"resolved","id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)$、旧版 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 分别见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]、[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]、[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]；终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"此 CNF 是禁止起始符号直接产生单字母的原接口，**不是**标准 $\\operatorname{CNF}$；标准转换见 [[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\cap\\Sigma^1=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}2.1}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L=L(G)","display":true}],"bytes":1789,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c0217e1a08a868eb","ade63126a30a65e4","351f87e03faac193","67f26c889bc89ed8","7505f1b37c6f6f74","0a6da8c909717780"]}